@host=http://localhost:5050

### Start the diagnostics workflow
# @name startDiagnostics
POST {{host}}/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": "{{$guid}}",
    "ship_name": "USS Enterprise NCC-1701-D",
    "diagnostics_date": "2370-04-08",
    "engineer_name": "Geordi La Forge"
}

### Get the workflow status (uses the workflow_id Conductor generated)
@instanceId={{startDiagnostics.response.body.$.workflow_id}}
GET {{host}}/status/{{instanceId}}

### Terminate the workflow
POST {{host}}/terminate/{{instanceId}}
